Public pages built around a shelf of cardboard boxes (one per marketplace or
per corner of the seller's home), with Poulpe the octopus as mascot:
- / : hero stack of 8 marketplace boxes, buyer/seller entry points, screenpipe pitch
- /chercher : text or photo search with colour/material/condition/budget filters,
  boxes open one by one as results come in, screenpipe 'seen on screen' memories
- /inventaire : seller stock boxes that open to list items, repeated tasks
  detected by screenpipe with one-click automations

Data is demo data (src/lib/demo-data.ts); screenpipe is read locally from
localhost:3030 with a demo fallback.

